  "body": "`docs/images/pr-1639-workbench/before.png` (507 KB) and `after.png` (493 KB) came in with PR #1639 (`bcf82a735`, 2026-11-14). They are before/after screenshots for that PR's review. Nothing in the tree uses them (`git grep pr-1639-workbench` finds nothing), so every clone carries about 1 MB of unused images.\n\nPR screenshots belong in the PR description, not in the repository.\n\nDone means: `docs/images/pr-1639-workbench/` is gone from `main`; the tutorial images `docs/images/first-part-*.png` (rendered by `gpu_render.rs`) stay.\n",
